---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="好用机场 - 首页" 
  description="好用机场是一个全新的博客"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-glow"></div>
    <div class="page-shell hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> 优中选优 · 实时更新</p>
        <h1>好用机场推荐<br><em>2026 好用 · 稳定 · 性价比的机场推荐</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">挑选靠谱节点，认准「好用机场」<br>我们用心为您筛选优质网络服务，助您在购买前全面了解各大服务商的真实延迟、套餐价格与隐藏风险，拒绝盲目跟风踩坑。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/recommend/">查看机场推荐 <span>→</span></a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/buying-guide/">新手选购指南</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note"><i>✓</i> 评测数据客观透明，坚决抵制跑路机场</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-right">
        <div class="hero-image">
          <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="好用机场 品牌标志" />
        </div>
        <div class="tech-stats-card">
          <div class="stats-header">
            <div class="stats-number"><strong>核心</strong> <span>选购指标</span></div>
            <span class="pulse-badge">持续监控</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="stats-list">
            <li><i>·</i> <div><b>看重性价比</b>，花最少的钱用最快的网</div></li>
            <li><i>·</i> <div><b>关注稳定性</b>，晚高峰看视频不缓冲</div></li>
            <li><i>·</i> <div><b>规避跑路险</b>，带你避开口碑崩坏的服务商</div></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
